              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Melanie Everett"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this for a super bowl party. It definately has a lot of heat and for the less adventurous you can try one jalapeno OR omit the cayenne pepper. Great with Carne Asada."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
