            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ljoym"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great combination of ingredients. Love the addition of corn and diced red bell pepper. I added no jalapeno seeds, just the flesh. Next time I'll try a few, and then a few more, until I find the right heat for us.",
